{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1706","id":4131026708,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p872OncU","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1706","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1706.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1706.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1706","number":1706,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[9709] Fail closed Semantic Stage 2 walking repair","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1705\n\nStacked on `task/1703-9709-semantic-stage-2-walking` while #1704 remains open. This PR does not merge or rewrite the failed Stage 2 evidence.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe reviewed `run_v1` four-Gate PASS was not trustworthy: its validator accepted empty Layer B, rejected resolver decisions, forged Layer A hashes, dangling ProcedureStep references, missing citations, collapsed maker/checker identities, and contradictory replay hashes. The evidence chain also relied on self-asserted source verification, ordinal MarkPoint bindings, and a replay that copied generated documents instead of independently reconstructing them.\n\n## Repair\n\n- preserves all 17 `run_v1` files byte-for-byte and publishes an additive `run_v2`\n- roots the repair skeleton to the exact 48-member selection, 3,497-row structural corpus, source registry/inventory, public QP/MS document hashes, and 175 reconstructed authority regions\n- introduces a generic fail-closed validator for authenticated cross-ledger conservation, separated review principals and custody, accepted resolver rationale, semantic MarkPoint/ProcedureStep binding, distinct alternative paths, and reconstructed preview/citation/readback objects\n- performs two independent filesystem reconstructions and requires byte-identical replay\n- preserves negative regressions for all seven reported mutations, coordinated cross-artifact forgery, and continuation deletion\n- records independent Layer A/B/C/resolver comment packets as candidate external evidence only; none is promoted to an approval receipt\n- deterministically supersedes the seven resolver-identified taxonomy-review members with provisional candidates while retaining exact 16/16/16 family counts; membership remains explicitly not admitted pending fresh independent reviews\n- keeps Layer B, Layer C, and preview empty, all four Gates FAIL, and Stage 3 blocked\n- records zero sealed-holdout access, zero provider spend, and zero structural/canonical/production/mastery/KG/downstream writes\n\n## Evidence state\n\n- repair commit: `3a9ebdbd938fe8a09f934e1d209917ba0c08bea7`\n- repair tree: `82bd7f828e75a10244d230b6aa126d9603a07ccd`\n- frozen predecessor/reviewed head: `17846a20351e39400e439d014203ff4e601c7bae`\n- `artifact-manifest.v2.json`: `c4faf6568f3a276824bbbcd4099015881945dd887d5f0bad622522de671a23c7`\n- four-Gate receipt: `36c9aa038dd889d83c8fa682286881006339ed15a3992e7cf232152d798da756`\n- deterministic replay receipt: `d34feccbfa2a19dae791a5596417ae58ece7792881fbee2bdf5122cfd5d7a83c`\n- selection supersession plan: `70749116ba395f520a0e26e97f378d9614985b72dd663691ee83a2e0b8826b3f`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1705_semantic_stage2_repair.test.py` — 16 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1705_semantic_stage2_repair.py --validate-only` — PASS reconstruction; Gate FAIL; Stage 3 false\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1703_semantic_stage2_walking.test.py` — 13 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1701_semantic_stage1.test.py` — passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1694_final_consolidation.test.py` — passed\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — artifact guard and maintainability checks healthy; only expected dirty/upstream warnings before commit/push\n- `git diff --cached --check` — passed\n\n## Admission\n\nThis PR intentionally does not claim semantic approval. Merge into the Stage 2 task branch requires an independent exact-head PASS with zero actionable findings and zero unresolved threads. Only then may #1704 receive a new exact-head independent review.\n","created_at":"2026-07-25T04:22:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T04:31:35Z","closed_at":"2026-07-25T04:31:35Z","merged_at":"2026-07-25T04:31:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"b769088723b2a5dd51b5f3b6fb66ceaa5f6eb1ef","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1706/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1706/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1706/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/3a9ebdbd938fe8a09f934e1d209917ba0c08bea7","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1705-semantic-stage-2-repair","ref":"task/1705-semantic-stage-2-repair"